### Ajouter un manhua
POST http://localhost:3000/addManhua
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titre": "Soul Land",
  "nombreDeChapitres": 300
}

### Ajouter un manhua avec image (multipart)
# Exemple curl :
#   curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/addManhua \
#     -F "titre=Tales of Demons and Gods" \
#     -F "nombreDeChapitres=450" \
#     -F "image=@/chemin/local/tales.jpg"
POST http://localhost:3000/addManhua
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="titre"

Tales of Demons and Gods
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="nombreDeChapitres"

450
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="tales.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./tales.jpg
------Boundary--

### Voir tous les manhuas
GET http://localhost:3000/getAllManhua

### Ajouter des chapitres
PATCH http://localhost:3000/manhua/YOUR-UUID-HERE/addChapters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 5
}

### Ajouter des chapitres lus
PATCH http://localhost:3000/manhua/YOUR-UUID-HERE/addReadChapters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 3
}

### Supprimer des chapitres
PATCH http://localhost:3000/manhua/YOUR-UUID-HERE/removeChapters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 2
}

### Supprimer des chapitres lus
PATCH http://localhost:3000/manhua/YOUR-UUID-HERE/removeReadChapters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 1
}

### Désactiver un manhua
PATCH http://localhost:3000/disableManhua/YOUR-UUID-HERE
